{"about_the_game":"After many years of living in the hustle and bustle of the city, you decide to take a radical step \u2013 moving to the countryside. It turns out that you've inherited an old farm that has been in your family for generations. Intrigued by the possibility of change, you leave your current life behind and embark on a journey to the countryside.<br><br>Upon arriving, you discover that the farm needs a lot of work to restore it to its former glory. While searching through the old house, you come across an ancient gardening book. It turns out to be a family journal, where knowledge of cultivating rare vegetable varieties has been recorded for generations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIG</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/cf86157b0f1741e0aaf81c765a0036d9.poster.avif?t=1765312190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/cf86157b0f1741e0aaf81c765a0036d9.webm?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/cf86157b0f1741e0aaf81c765a0036d9.mp4?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Dig and loosen the soil to prepare the ideal conditions for your plants to grow. Pay attention to the soil quality, its moisture, and nutrient content \u2013 all of which affect the health of your vegetables.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/d025de78fba4b849bc1d5042da8af24e.poster.avif?t=1765312190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/d025de78fba4b849bc1d5042da8af24e.webm?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/d025de78fba4b849bc1d5042da8af24e.mp4?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Grow a wide range of vegetables, from traditional to rare and unique varieties. Plant directly in the ground or in pots, buy ready-made seedlings, or create your own from rare and trusted varieties.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/6455f4a309460bbeb382181ad7cf135f.poster.avif?t=1765312190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/6455f4a309460bbeb382181ad7cf135f.webm?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/6455f4a309460bbeb382181ad7cf135f.mp4?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Learn to recognize the needs of your vegetables, adjusting fertilization, watering, and protection according to their specific requirements. Face the challenges posed by pests and plant diseases. Use natural protection methods and organic products to safeguard your crops.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/18687eca9bce126e7a3e931299225659.poster.avif?t=1765312190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/18687eca9bce126e7a3e931299225659.webm?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/18687eca9bce126e7a3e931299225659.mp4?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each plant requires unique care. Prune, train shoots, tie them with strings, and build supports to ensure optimal growth and higher yields.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SELLING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/060ed108f7fbda462c281be79e06f35d.poster.avif?t=1765312190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/060ed108f7fbda462c281be79e06f35d.webm?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/060ed108f7fbda462c281be79e06f35d.mp4?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Harvest your crops and sell them to local shops and supermarkets that value the quality and freshness of your products. Accept orders, build relationships with buyers, and negotiate prices.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESS</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/d040ef6b1047b9cf57145f9bfc60ca08.poster.avif?t=1765312190\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/d040ef6b1047b9cf57145f9bfc60ca08.webm?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185200/extras/d040ef6b1047b9cf57145f9bfc60ca08.mp4?t=1765312190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Invest the money you earn into developing your farm. Buy new tools, expand your fields, and build additional greenhouses and irrigation systems. Everything has its specific use and will help you tailor conditions to the needs of your plants.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3185200?t=1765312190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai